  "body": "Extracted and ported the logic wavefront kernel from #770 using Claude so it's easier to understand and compare with the previous iterations. It should hopefully make it easier to figure out how we can shave some of the timing down / make it more tuneable for different machines.\r\n\r\n**TODO**\r\n- Extract non-logic kernel features to the webgpu/mis branch to avoid conflating timing improvements\r\n- Improve tune-ability\r\n- Clean up\r\n- Review\r\n\r\nSome other perf / feature improvements (some from #770):\r\n- Use \"any hit\" for shadow rays\r\n- Add filter glossy factor\r\n- Skip creating and running final rays that don't run\r\n- Terminate pdf <= 0 rays\r\n- Thin down struct footprint?\r\n\r\ncc @TheBlek ",
